    "detailed_description": "<i>&quot;Some stories are best told to none,&quot; she whispered.</i><br><br>Long ago, the stars disappeared. Then, a man returned them. Few would believe such a thing; fewer still can recall his name or how he bent the heavens' ears. It's a story of romance and tragedy that the stars themselves testify of to this day.<br><br>However, you won't find the tale in books or archives\u2014only in the hearts of those who were there.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993140/extras/4208b89fa46c023abc7ae19ec680fe9c.avif?t=1718825346\" width=600 height=284 /></span><br><br>For Whom the Stars Shine is a short kinetic visual novel\u2014a story without choices or branching paths created by New Dialog and cowritten by Pony with a Pen. Character sprites were drawn by Ruvik, and all background art was created by GoodDay.",
